# ---- added 2026-08-08, solver unification ----
# Build variants: the tmp_build_dir rule above misses suffixed variants such as
# tmp_build_fallback_nonreg_afd_teno, which leaked ~2.6 GB of .o/.d into the
# untracked set.
**/tmp_build*
**/o/2d.*.EXE/
**/o/3d.*.EXE/
**/*.ex.*backup

# Simulation and analysis output kept outside the repo
**/output/
**/aws_plt/
**/*.npz
**/Level_[0-9]*/
**/*_metadata/

